## When and where

kpi Thursday 2026-11-12 | 17:30 to 19:30 | Main building, 410 Elm Street

! Join us in the main building at 410 Elm Street. Come for the whole evening or just a part.

## Schedule

step Welcome from the principal | 17:30 | Gym
step Classroom tours | 17:50 | Groups of 8 families, about 30 minutes each
step Kindergarten information session | 18:30 | Library
step After-school program table | 18:45 | Cafeteria
step Closing words | 19:15

## What to bring

Planning to register for 2027-28 kindergarten? Bring these three items.

cards
### A birth certificate
For your child's registration.
### Proof of address
Bring it with you on the night.
### Immunization records
Keep them handy for the form.

kpi Registration opens | 2027-01-12 | 2027-28 kindergarten

## Getting here

cards
### Free parking
Use the Elm Street lot. It has 60 spaces.
### Free shuttle
A shuttle runs every 10 minutes from the Pine Street church lot.
### Sibling childcare
Childcare for siblings is offered in the music room.

